    "detailed_description": "In the exciting game &quot;Pirate fishing&quot; you play as a fisherman and your task is to catch as many fish as possible to earn a lot of money.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNot satisfied with the pace of production? Spend money on pumping your fishing rod:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Controllability - the higher, the easier it is to control the direction of movement of the fishing hook.<br />\r\n- The length of the reel affects the depth from which you can catch fish.<br />\r\n- Speed - affects how fast you can get the prey out of the water.<br />\r\n- Fishing time - increase the duration of fishing.<br />\r\n- Dexterity - increase your level, the higher, the easier it will be to catch a fish.<br />\r\n- Bait - Raise the bait level in order to attract more fish species.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPump up your fishing rod and try to set a record for catching fish every time!",
    "about_the_game": "In the exciting game &quot;Pirate fishing&quot; you play as a fisherman and your task is to catch as many fish as possible to earn a lot of money.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNot satisfied with the pace of production? Spend money on pumping your fishing rod:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Controllability - the higher, the easier it is to control the direction of movement of the fishing hook.<br />\r\n- The length of the reel affects the depth from which you can catch fish.<br />\r\n- Speed - affects how fast you can get the prey out of the water.<br />\r\n- Fishing time - increase the duration of fishing.<br />\r\n- Dexterity - increase your level, the higher, the easier it will be to catch a fish.<br />\r\n- Bait - Raise the bait level in order to attract more fish species.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPump up your fishing rod and try to set a record for catching fish every time!",
    "short_description": "In the exciting game &quot;Pirate fishing&quot; you play as a fisherman and your task is to catch as many fish as possible to earn a lot of money. Pump up your fishing rod and try to set a record for catching fish every time!",
